        "comment_text": "SELECT L.LogEntryId as id_log, \nL.ReportID as id_relatorio, \nC.ItemID AS id_item, \nC.Path AS caminho, \nC.Name AS nome_item,\nSUBSTRING(C.Path, CHARINDEX('/', C.Path)+1, IIF(CHARINDEX('/', C.Path,2) > 0 ,CHARINDEX('/', C.Path,2) - 2, LEN(C.Path))) AS item_raiz,\nc.ParentID AS id_item_pai, \nC.Type AS tipo_item, \nC.PolicyID AS id_politica,\nS.UserID AS id_usuario,\nL.username login_usuario_log, \nS.UserName as login_usuario, \nFORMAT(L.TimeStart, 'yyyMMdd') as data_log, \nconvert(char(8), L.TimeStart, 108) as hora_log,\nReportAction as cod_acao \nFROM ExecutionLogStorage L \nFULL JOIN Catalog C ON L.ReportID = C.ItemID\nFULL JOIN Users S ON SUBSTRING(S.username, CHARINDEX('\\', S.username)+1, LEN(S.username)) = SUBSTRING(L.username, CHARINDEX('\\', L.username)+1, LEN(L.username))\n\nwhere S.UserName like '%hugo.fgomes%'\nand (\n\tC.Name like '%DELINTER%'\n\tor\n\tC.Path like '%/Painéis Corporativos/Painel de Gestão PBIRS%'\n)\nand FORMAT(L.TimeStart, 'yyyMMdd') = 20260305\n\nORDER BY L.TimeStart DESC;\n",
